    "commit": "d5ef1f5265134da281bef53eadf7af84dea2c702",
    "commit_body": "The v35 miss-ledger (ledger_v35_1825.parquet, 40,693 signals) showed +4.7pp\nresidual miss-lift in the CSWC zone on CALL 75+: wadj\u2208[1,12) \u2227 stoch<35\nmissing at 43.0% vs cohort baseline 38.3% (N=2,082). v34 K=0.30 was\nunder-dampening, and the wadj\u2208[12,14) band remained uncovered.\n\nv35 K-resweep (experiments/stoch_wadj_v35_resweep.py, 144 variants over\nsn\u2208{33,35,37,40} \u00d7 wg\u2208{12,13,14,15} \u00d7 K\u2208{0.30..0.65}): 44 variants pass\nH1+H3+H4+H5. Selected sn=35, wg=14, K=0.50 \u2014 preserves v34's COMP_BINS\nsemantic anchor while widening the gate by +2pp and strengthening K by\n+0.20.\n\nPer-tier 5y TP% deltas vs live v35 K=0.30 baseline:\n  95+: +1.77pp / 90+: +2.19pp / 85+: +0.66pp\n  80+: +1.91pp / 75+: +0.88pp\nN drops within H3 \u00b115% (75+ -9.6%, 80+ -13.8%, 85+ -13.6%).\nSign-consistent 1y/3y/5y on all primary tiers. Puts unchanged.\n\nGradient form preserved \u2014 no cliff thresholds added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "commit_short": "d5ef1f52",
